CPU and Memory Impact
mTLS adds computational overhead for encryption and decryption. Monitor resource usage:

# Monitor CPU and memory usage
kubectl top pods -n microservices

# Check detailed resource metrics
kubectl exec -n microservices test-client -- curl -s http://localhost:15000/stats | grep -E "(cpu|memory)"
Latency Impact
Measure the latency impact of mTLS:

# Test latency with mTLS enabled
kubectl exec -n microservices test-client -- time curl -s http://product-service.microservices.svc.cluster.local/

# Compare with baseline measurements
kubectl exec -n microservices test-client -- curl -w "@curl-format.txt" -s http://product-service.microservices.svc.cluster.local/
